  "changelog_v2_0_0_bullet_1": "Completely redesigned app: notes, tasks and calendar in one place, synced to your account.",
  "changelog_v2_0_0_bullet_2": "Notes with custom styles, Markdown, checklists, audio notes, links between notes and 6 ready-made templates.",
  "changelog_v2_0_0_bullet_3": "Tasks with lists, subtasks, due dates, recurrences and special tasks.",
  "changelog_v2_0_0_bullet_4": "New calendar with day, week, month, year and schedule views, birthdays and name days, ICS import and export.",
  "changelog_v2_0_0_bullet_5": "Reminders for notes, tasks and events, with a dedicated screen.",
  "changelog_v2_0_0_bullet_6": "Labels, archive and trash with automatic deletion after 7 days.",
  "changelog_v2_0_0_bullet_7": "Statistics, note export to PDF, TXT, JSON, CSV and HTML, manual and automatic backups.",
  "changelog_v2_0_0_bullet_8": "Widget for the Android home screen.",
  "changelog_v2_0_0_bullet_9": "\"Undo\" button after moving notes, tasks and events to the trash or archive.",
  "changelog_v2_0_0_bullet_10": "Deleting a note or a task from the editor now moves it to the trash instead of deleting it permanently.",
  "changelog_v2_0_0_bullet_11": "Pull down on notes and tasks to refresh them, for example after a connection error or changes made on another device.",
  "changelog_v2_0_0_bullet_12": "\"Retry\" button when syncing fails and \"Create your first note\" when you don't have any yet.",
  "changelog_v2_0_0_bullet_13": "Swipe a task right to complete it or left to move it to the trash; in list view, swipe a note right to archive it or left to trash it.",
  "changelog_v2_0_0_bullet_14": "Date and time pickers, system menus and dates in the app's language.",
  "changelog_v2_0_0_bullet_15": "If the app fails to start, a message with a Retry button appears instead of a blank screen.",
  "changelog_v2_0_0_bullet_16": "A first-launch introduction that presents the app's features, always available from App info.",
  "changelog_v2_0_0_bullet_17": "Restore automatic backups: in Settings, open the backup list and tap the one to restore.",
  "changelog_v2_0_0_bullet_18": "Importing a full backup now really removes notes, tasks and events that are not part of it, instead of having them reappear after a restart.",
  "changelog_v2_0_0_bullet_19": "ICS calendar: exported recurring events keep their end date, imported ones no longer lose the last occurrence across a daylight saving change, times with an explicit time zone stay correct and text with backslashes is read properly.",
  "changelog_v2_0_0_bullet_20": "While notes and tasks load for the first time, a preview of the list appears instead of the spinner, with a smoother transition between loading, list and empty screen.",
  "changelog_v2_0_0_bullet_21": "New \"masonry\" Home grid: each note takes only the space it needs, with no gaps between short notes and without cutting long ones.",
  "changelog_v2_0_0_bullet_22": "Tapping a reminder notification opens the linked note, task or event directly, even when the app is closed.",
  "changelog_v2_0_0_bullet_23": "Smoother animations: a note expands from its card when you open it and switching between menu sections fades. They stay off when the system's reduced animations are on.",
  "changelog_v2_0_0_bullet_24": "Accessibility: with TalkBack each note is read in full and the quick actions (pin, archive, trash, move) are in the Actions menu; with very large system text, cards and fields are no longer cut off, and bottom sheets no longer end up under the navigation bar.",
  "changelog_v2_0_0_bullet_25": "Offline mode: changes made without a connection are saved on the device and sent as soon as you are back online, with a notice while they are pending. On the web, data stays available offline too.",
  "changelog_v2_0_0_bullet_26": "A more consistent look: section headers, settings items, archive and trash items and labels now share the same style across the app, and delete confirmations always use the red button.",
  "changelog_v2_0_0_bullet_27": "New app icon: the light bulb with a check mark on a dark background, which adapts to the shape chosen by the launcher and to the color themes of Android 13 and later.",
  "changelog_v2_0_0_bullet_28": "The new app logo also appears on the sign-in and sign-up screen, the loading screen and the Info page.",
  "changelog_v2_0_0_bullet_29": "Links in notes: with the \"Insert link\" button you add a link to a website, and in the Markdown preview you just tap it to open it in the browser. Addresses typed by hand become clickable too.",
  "changelog_v2_0_0_bullet_30": "Account deletion: in Settings, after confirming your password or Google account, you can permanently delete your account together with all your notes, tasks and events.",
  "changelog_v2_0_0_bullet_31": "New option in Settings > Notes: choose whether the notes + button opens the menu with note, checklist, task, audio and template or creates a new note right away. From the menu, \"Task\" now opens a new task directly.",
  "changelog_v2_0_0_bullet_32": "The app is now also available in English: it follows your phone's language, or you can choose it in Settings > Language.",
